Mainly just modelling the main character/object. 
Various screenshots from the 11th show the model before and after optimisation .
(From 17k triangles to 10k by removing the majority of unneccessary loops, as the quad based geomoetry wasn't needed for a flat mesh that isn't twisting/warping etc.)
